    "text": "<p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now rearranging the above integral we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyl